== Notes ==
*Since rangers receive this feat automatically, it cannot be selected when gaining a ranger level (even prior to receiving it automatically).
* The [[dual-wield (feat)|dual-wield]] feat does not satisfy this feat's prerequisites.

==Builder notes==
'''Item feat:''' No, but it can be added with custom content.

==Custom content notes==
'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes

'''Script:''' hardcoded

*This feat can be added to [[iprp_feats.2da]] to make it available as an item feat. It will then work without the player needing ''ambidexterity'' or ''two-weapon fighting'' (or [[dual-wield (feat)|dual-wield]]), but doing so incurs all the standard two-weapon penalties for the extra off-hand attack.